---
---

<section class="learn" id="learn-section">
  <div style="height: 50px;"></div>
  <h2>Here's what you'll learn:</h2>

  <div class="learn-grid">
    <div class="lesson">
      <div class="num">01</div>
      <div class="ttl">Product Hunting:</div>
      <div class="body">How to identify a winning product and which products you must avoid.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson">
      <div class="num">02</div>
      <div class="ttl">Finding a reliable supplier:</div>
      <div class="body">How to find a reliable supplier (locally and Alibaba) and negotiate the best prices.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson">
      <div class="num">03</div>
      <div class="ttl">Building the store:</div>
      <div class="body">How to build an online store on Shopify and set up Whish as your payment gateway.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson">
      <div class="num">04</div>
      <div class="ttl">Create &amp; Run Ads:</div>
      <div class="body">How to create advertisements and run on social media to attract customers to your online store.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson">
      <div class="num">05</div>
      <div class="ttl">Q&amp;A with Majd:</div>
      <div class="body">Whatever question you have, Majd will answer them all to make sure you leave with a clear plan for starting your business.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bonus: spans 2 cols -->
    <div class="lesson bonus">
      <svg class="gift-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="6" y="22" width="52" height="36" rx="3"/>
        <line x1="32" y1="22" x2="32" y2="58"/>
        <line x1="6" y1="34" x2="58" y2="34"/>
        <path d="M32 22c-8-12-22-2-10 0"/>
        <path d="M32 22c8-12 22-2 10 0"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="num bonus-num">Bonus Gift!</div>
      <span class="worth">Worth $997</span>
      <div class="body" style="margin-top:14px; font-size:18px;">Those who stay until the very end of the workshop will receive <strong>+7 guides</strong> that will kickstart your dropshipping journey.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="final-cta">
    <h3>More than you'll ever get from YouTube or other gurus</h3>
    <a href="#register" class="cta-btn">Secure Your Spot Now!</a>
    <div class="fineprint">Replays aren't guaranteed so make sure you don't miss out!</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .learn {
    background: #E0E0E0;
    padding: 30px 0 50px;
  }
  .learn h2 {
    margin: 0 0 50px;
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #000;
  }

  .learn-grid {
    max-width: 1225px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .lesson:nth-child(-n+3) { grid-column: span 2; }
  .lesson:nth-child(4),
  .lesson:nth-child(5)    { grid-column: span 3; }

  .lesson {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #000c3d 0%, #001575 45%, #002199 70%, #001060 100%);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 26px 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0,21,115,0.18);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .num {
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 40px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .ttl {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .body {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
  }

  /* Bonus card */
  .bonus {
    grid-column: 1 / span 6;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #000c3d 0%, #001575 45%, #002199 70%, #001060 100%);
    position: relative;
  }
  .bonus::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, rgba(20,173,0,0.25), transparent 45%);
    border-radius: 28px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .bonus-num {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 44px;
  }
  .worth {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgb(20, 173, 0);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .gift-icon {
    position: absolute;
    right: 32px;
    top: 32px;
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
    color: #fff;
    opacity: 0.85;
    transform: rotate(-10deg);
  }

  /* Final CTA */
  .final-cta {
    margin-top: 64px;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .final-cta h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 36px);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #000;
  }
  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgb(20, 173, 0);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 18px 56px;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 rgb(7, 97, 12), 0 14px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    transition: transform .12s ease, box-shadow .12s ease;
  }
  .cta-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 rgb(7, 97, 12), 0 10px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }
  .fineprint {
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .learn h2 { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .learn-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
    .lesson:nth-child(-n+3),
    .lesson:nth-child(4),
    .lesson:nth-child(5),
    .bonus { grid-column: 1; }
    .gift-icon { width: 60px; height: 60px; right: 16px; top: 16px; }
    .final-cta { margin-top: 40px; }
    .cta-btn { font-size: 16px; padding: 12px 28px; width: auto; }
  }
</style>
